omiting, fatigue). Solicited AEs were collected by systematic assessment through participant e-diaries. Safety Analysis Set: participants who entered into study and received at least 1 dose of vaccination. Participants were analyzed according to the actual treatment received.","eventGroups":[{"id":"EG000","title":"Group 1: VLA15","description":"Participants aged 5 to 65 years received three intramuscular vaccinations of 180 microgram (mcg) VLA15 at Month 0, 2 and 6 during the Main Study Phase. Eligible participants will receive booster dose of VLA15 at Month 18, 30 and 42 during the Booster Phase.","deathsNumAffected":0,"deathsNumAtRisk":190,"seriousNumAffected":0,"seriousNumAtRisk":190,"otherNumAffected":178,"otherNumAtRisk":190},{"id":"EG001","title":"Group 2: VLA15 + Placebo","description":"Participants aged 5 to 65 years received two intramuscular vaccinations of 180 mcg VLA15 at Month 0 and 6 and a placebo injection at Month 2 during the Main Study Phase. Eligible participants will receive booster dose of VLA15 at Month 18, 30 and 42 during the Booster Phase.","deathsNumAffected":0,"deathsNumAtRisk":187,"seriousNumAffected":2,"seriousNumAtRisk":187,"otherNumAffected":179,"otherNumAtRisk":187},{"id":"EG002","title":"Group 3: Placebo","description":"Participants aged 5 to 65 years received three intramuscular vaccinations of placebo at Month 0, 2 and 6 during the Main Study Phase. Eligible participants will receive placebo injection at Month 18, 30 and 42 during the Booster Phase.","deathsNumAffected":0,"deathsNumAtRisk":208,"seriousNumAffected":4,"seriousNumAtRisk":208,"otherNumAffected":133,"otherNumAtRisk":208},{"id":"EG003","title":"Any VLA15","description":"Participants aged 5 to 65 years who received intramuscular vaccinations of 180 mcg VLA15 at either Month 0, 2 or 6 during the Main Study Phase were included. This arm also included participants who received wrong vaccination or missed a vaccination and could not be assigned to Group 1 or 2.","deathsNumAffected":0,"deathsNumAtRisk":417,"seriousNumAffected":3,"seriousNumAtRisk":417,"otherNumAffected":391,"otherNumAtRisk":417},{"id":"EG004","title":"All Participants","description":"Participants aged 5 to 65 years who received intramuscular vaccination of either 180 mcg VLA15 or placebo during the Main Study Phase were included. This arm also included participants who received wrong vaccination or missed a vaccination.","deathsNumAffected":0,"deathsNumAtRisk":625,"seriousNumAffected":7,"seriousNumAtRisk":625,"otherNumAffected":524,"otherNumAtRisk":625}],"seriousEvents":[{"term":"Major depression","organSystem":"Psychiatric disorders","sourceVocabulary":"MedDRA 25.0","assessmentType":"NON_SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT","stats":[{"groupId":"EG000","numEvents":0,"numAffected":0,"numAtRisk":190},{"groupId":"EG001","numEvents":1,"numAffected":1,"numAtRisk":187},{"groupId":"EG002","numEvents":0,"numAffected":0,"numAtRisk":208},{"groupId":"EG003","numEvents":1,"numAffected":1,"numAtRisk":417},{"groupId":"EG004","numEvents":1,"numAffected":1,"numAtRisk":625}]},{"term":"Reactive attachment disorder of infancy or early childhood","organSystem":"Psychiatric disorders","sourceVocabulary":"MedDRA 25.0","assessmentType":"NON_SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT","stats":[{"groupId":"EG000","numEvents":0,"numAffected":0,"numAtRisk":190},{"groupId":"EG001","numEvents":0,"numAffected":0,"numAtRisk":187},{"groupId":"EG002","numEvents":1,"numAffected":1,"numAtRisk":208},{"groupId":"EG003","numEvents":0,"numAffected":0,"numAtRisk":417},{"groupId":"EG004","numEvents":1,"numAffected":1,"numAtRisk":625}]},{"term":"Suicidal ideation","organSystem":"Psychiatric disorders","sourceVocabulary":"MedDRA 25.0","assessmentType":"NON_SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT","stats":[{"groupId":"EG000","numEvents":0,"numAffected":0,"numAtRisk":190},{"groupId":"EG001","numEvents":0,"numAffected":0,"numAtRisk":187},{"groupId":"EG002","numEvents":2,"numAffected":1,"numAtRisk":208},{"groupId":"EG003","numEvents":0,"numAffected":0,"numAtRisk":417},